  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Current implementation",
      "items": [
        "One Python application. Registry functions save summaries and owner emails in data/issued.json; transaction rows are excluded.",
        "Uploads remain in session state; parsed results have no cache expiry. Demo sign-in accepts an email without proving ownership."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Parsing, feeds and rates",
      "items": [
        "Browser CSV uses the selected currency; CLI defaults to SGD. PDF text goes to Anthropic using ANTHROPIC_API_KEY. Bank feeds read fixtures.",
        "Web FX caches for one hour, then falls back by currency (unknown: 1.0). CLI always uses 0.58. Fallbacks are indicative."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Checks and sharing",
      "items": [
        "The gate checks arithmetic and date order, not authenticity or creditworthiness. Code lookup compares the stored summary, not bank data.",
        "QR and HTTP links open the same app and require network reachability. mailto opens a draft; it neither sends nor attaches the PDF."
      ]
    }
  ]
